ity and ingenuity. <br></li><li><strong>Open World:</strong> Traverse the striking, procedurally generated open world, with new challenges over every horizon.<br></li><li><strong>Make Mars Home:</strong> Watch new buildings spring up as you complete deliveries. Connect buildings using roads, monorails, power lines, water pipes and more!<br></li><li><strong>Unlock Parts:</strong> Unlock and combine parts like servo motors, hydraulic cylinders and rocket engines. <br></li><li><strong>Co-op:</strong> Tackle the challenge solo, or recruit up to 3 friends in online co-op.<br></li><li><strong>Play your way:</strong> Play in standard or creative modes or tweak individual game settings to your liking.</li></ul>","developers":["Shape Shop"],"dlc":[2465430],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532200/header.jpg?t=1768886885","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2022-2025 Shape Shop Pty Ltd","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1532200/1101709321/3628882775d2368e582d1198150ee0794b5da229/1758780100/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758841079","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1532200/1101709321/3628882775d2368e582d1198150ee0794b5da229/1758780100/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758841079","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1532200/1101709321/3628882775d2368e582d1198150ee0794b5da229/1758780100/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758841079","id":257205947,"name":"1.0 Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/